Output format:
Return the reply block, always required, exactly once, as valid JSON with double quotes, no markdown:
{
  "fotogramApp": [
    {
      "from": "specified recipient name",
      "to": "specified sender name",
      "message": "the recipient's reply"
    }
  ]
}
Use exactly one message in this Fotogram reply. from is the recipient who is answering; to is the sender of the newest incoming message. isVoiceMessage and sendImageId are ignored in Fotogram. When only the reply is needed, return only this object.

